  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Savaloise Association of Physically Disabled Persons (Association Savaloise des Handicaps Moteurs (ASHAM))</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to expand the groups business and also accommodate their limitations and ensure the sustainability of the organization. Funds will be used to construct a facility with necessary accommodations and provide training in accounting and financial management, internal controls, small business management, marketing, sewing, hairdressing, and weaving refresher training.</narrative>
  </description>
